    "description": "JTP Co.,Ltd. provides outsourcing services to specialized technical services companies in Japan and internationally. It operates through four segments: Digital Innovation Business, ICT Business, Life Science Business, and Other Business. The Digital Innovation Business segment provides a human resource development solution service that provides LearningBooster, a learning data utilization platform for IT engineers; security service that provides proposal and implementation of preventative security solutions to operation, maintenance, and continuous improvement activities; and DX development service that supports the promotion of DX in companies. Its ICT Business segment offers design, construction, operation and maintenance services for ICT systems. The Life Science Business segment provides maintenance services for medical equipment, chemical analyzers, etc.; consulting services for overseas medical device manufacturers; and ICT services in the life sciences field. It serves ICT manufacturers and end users. The company was formerly known as Japan Third Party Co., Ltd. and changed its name to JTP Co.,Ltd. in April 2021. JTP Co.,Ltd. was incorporated in 1987 and is headquartered in Shinagawa, Japan."
